requirements.detail:
Under Amendment No. 3 (October 2024), insect nets are classified into four distinct standard varieties based on mesh size and mass:
a) Type I: 30 mesh (Mass: 90 g/m²);
b) Type II: 40 mesh (Mass: 105 g/m²);
c) Type II A: 40 mesh (Mass: 125 g/m²);
d) Type III: 50 mesh (Mass: 125 g/m²).
